Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.36,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:10.90,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a smile comes to the lips of Linda Noskova,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N诺斯科娃脸上露出了笑容
