Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:17.70,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}11{\fs68}日清晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:20.53,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}印第安韦尔斯年终总决赛小组赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:21.78,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}第一次来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:25.26,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}诺斯科娃怎样率先拿到四强门票？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:53.14,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}从底线对拉到网前 再退回底线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.14,0:00:55.47,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}诺斯科娃赢下长回合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:58.65,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}可{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先后 高芙连追两局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:01.34,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}她得先稳住自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:06.13,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two set points saved.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她已救回两个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.13,0:01:10.47,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Coco looking to make it the trifecta, get herself to even terms.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N高芙想再救一个 先追到平分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:16.95,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But she'll find a half a dozen double faults her undoing,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但六次双误 让她付出了代价
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:19.77,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and American tennis fans at Indian Wells are beside themselves.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现场的美国球迷也坐不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:22.87,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}第二盘 诺斯科娃{\fs78}8{\fs68}次发球直接得分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:25.00,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}个发球局全部守住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.69,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}可多拍争夺还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:28.30,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}从底线打到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.35,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}每一分还得自己拿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:37.64,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Noskova continues to hold her at bay, but here's just a touch of pressure.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她仍压着高芙 但也有些压力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:46.19,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.30,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}同样是{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.63,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}这次她没有再让出发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.63,0:01:56.63,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}首战已赢下科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:58.20,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}再两盘拿下这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:00.27,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}就能提前打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:03.59,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}最后一道关 还得自己发球拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.15,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:15.69,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a smile comes to the lips of Linda Noskova,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N诺斯科娃脸上露出了笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.69,0:02:19.61,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who continues to sparkle in her WTA Finals debut.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首次出战年终总决赛 她继续闪耀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.59,0:02:25.93,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}74 minutes to dismiss Coco Gauff in straight sets,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}74{\fs68}分钟 直落两盘击败高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:27.49,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}three and three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两盘都是{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:32.44,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Linda Noskova makes a statement{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N诺斯科娃打出了自己的宣言
