Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:41.44,TL,,0,0,500,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Group 1 has its outright leader, Linda Noskova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N诺斯科娃在第一小组独自领跑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:44.94,TL,,0,0,500,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two for two as she moves through against Coco Gauff.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N击败高芙 两战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:46.99,TL,,0,0,500,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-three, six-three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:50.36,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}属于她的掌声 还在看台上回响
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:51.74,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}她已经打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:53.20,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}下一场对佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:56.40,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}能以三战全胜结束小组赛吗？
